<title>USA: IVAX names president/CEO at Zenith unit.</title>
<headline>IVAX names president/CEO at Zenith unit.</headline>
<dateline>MIAMI 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>IVAX Corp said Monday it named Dr Rafick Henein president and chief executive officer of its Zenith Goldline Pharmaceuticals Inc unit, IVAX's primary U.S. generic drug subsidiary..</p>
<p>Henein was formerly president and chief executive officer of Novopharm International, a division of the Novopharm Group.</p>
